%% Phase4 / timeline / G-10c 满窗口追加与淘汰
%% Helix owners: query/local_first.rs; channel/write/post.rs; event/timeline.rs; event/post.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  UI->>Gate: queryMessages(latest, bounded limit=20)
  Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_query_messages_by_channel", payload)
  Native->>E: Tick::Command(query)
  E->>IM: local-first query and attach timeline
  IM->>Host: Persist Scan bounded window
  Host->>DB: read current 20 rows and anchor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(window)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  UI->>Gate: sendMessage(new text)
  Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_send_message", payload)
  Native->>E: Tick::Command(send)
  E->>IM: optimistic send -> Persist P1
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist(message sending)
  Host->>DB: write temporary row
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(P1)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:sending
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/create
  Host->>Go: HTTP admission
  Go-->>Host: 2xx
  Go-->>WS: WS action=post(new id,event_seq)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post)
  E->>IM: dispatch G-01 authority
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(message + channel + member + cursor)
  Host->>DB: commit new message and current viewer facts
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet message/channel_member
  Host->>DB: readback message and bounded window
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:received
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:channel:update
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:update(direction=append)
  Sink-->>UI: append new row; evict oldest when window reaches 20
  Sink-->>FFI: batch post/channel/timeline raw bytes
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch post/channel/timeline raw bytes
  alt duplicate/gap/PersistErr
    IM->>IM: drop duplicate or buffer gap; no second append
  end
  Note over DB,UI: window bound、eviction、anchor/revision 由 Helix durable query 事实决定，Angular 不自行 splice 出第二份业务状态。
